# Environment template for sycm-automation.
#
# Copy to a real env file OUTSIDE this repository and pass its path to import
# commands via --env-file. Never commit real values, and never copy secrets
# into code, logs, manifests, receipts, or evidence.
#
# The current development machine uses: E:\小红书\.env.local
# (that absolute path is a local convenience only; do not rely on it in code).
#
# Names below are the variables actually read by this repository. Variables
# with defaults shown as comments are optional.

# --- Feishu application credentials (REQUIRED for any Feishu operation) ----
FEISHU_APP_ID=
FEISHU_APP_SECRET=

# --- PostgreSQL (REQUIRED for adaptive collection state authority) ---------
# Business-fact authority for xws_adaptive_runs / parts / manifests.
XWS_DATABASE_URL=

# --- PostgreSQL for integration tests only ---------------------------------
# Integration tests must report "skipped" (not pass) when this is unset.
XWS_TEST_DATABASE_URL=

# --- Browser access --------------------------------------------------------
# Ports and browser identities have ONE source of truth: runtime/browser-ports.mjs.
# Do not copy the numbers from here into code — read them from that module.
# Only a single browser-level CDP connection is allowed per proxy, and the proxy
# must report the browser identity the caller expects (exports compare
# XWS_BROWSER_ID against the proxy's /health browser.id).
#
# This project uses TWO browsers that must never share one instance:
#   competitor  (buyer account + 小旺神)  debug port 9222  proxy 3457  id edge-isolated
#   dailyReport (merchant account)        debug port 19022 proxy 19023 id edge-daily-report
# Start them with runtime/start-project-browser.mjs and
# runtime/start-daily-report-browser.mjs; start the proxies with
# runtime/isolated-proxy/cdp-proxy.mjs and runtime/start-daily-report-proxy.mjs.
#
# Overrides exist for non-default ports ONLY (they must stay in sync with the
# registry above). Leave them unset on a standard install.
# CDP_PROXY_PORT=
# CDP_BROWSER_PORT=
# CDP_TAB_IDLE_TIMEOUT=
# XWS_BROWSER_ID=
# SYCM_PROXY=
# XWS_PROXY=

# --- Interpreter overrides -------------------------------------------------
# Python interpreter used by the helper scripts.
# XWS_PYTHON=
# SYCM_PYTHON=

# --- Paths and limits ------------------------------------------------------
# Override the market-analysis run lock (default: <tmp>/xws-runs/.market-analysis.lock).
# XWS_MARKET_ANALYSIS_LOCK=
# Override the runtime output root.
# XWS_RUNTIME_DIR=

# --- Ad-hoc script inputs --------------------------------------------------
# Used only by runtime/import-history-via-api.mjs.
# FEISHU_SOURCE_CSV=
